{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>MicroWell 是一款主打即時紓壓的隨身應用，透過引導呼吸練習與微冥想，讓你在 30 至 120 秒內重新找回平靜，適合工作繁忙、容易緊張或需要隨時放鬆的都市人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>視覺呼吸圈即時紓壓</h2>\n<p>MicroWell 提供 30、60 或 120 秒的引導呼吸練習，配合視覺呼吸圈與觸感回饋，以科學化節奏加快放鬆；內置 45 秒至 5 分鐘微冥想庫，涵蓋專注、平靜、能量與睡眠分類。程式另設壓力預算功能，可記錄壓力誘因、追蹤每日與每週走勢，並以圖表呈現紓壓成功率，全程無訂閱、無廣告。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-64-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-65-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-66-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-67-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-68-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-69-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：MicroWell – Stress Relief</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T22:59:35.550097+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}